{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/214120-vampire-20th-online-game-in-miami","id":214120,"title":"Vampire 20th: Online Game in Miami","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-30T17:54:52-07:00","id":214120,"title":"Vampire 20th: Online Game in Miami","content":"Set in current day Miami, By Right of Blood is a 20th Edition Vampire: the Masquerade game, currently focused on the Sabbat. Just a few years ago, the Sword of Caine took Miami, and now they work to establish it as a major center of power. In the humid nights, from the city's neon downtown to its sodium lit slums, packs insinuate themselves among gangs and the vice trade, vampiric priests perform rituals spiced by voodoo and santeria, and Cainite scholars dig for secrets in forgotten buildings half-claimed by the swamp.<br /> <br /> But the sect is beset by enemies. From without, Setites and Baali slip into the city, quietly building up their power. Creatures stalk the swamps on the city's western border; pirates and rival smugglers patrol the ocean to the east. From within, Miami's Cainites struggle against each other, driven by vampiric nature and the Sword's conflicting ideals of freedom and loyalty. And, over all of this, the constant threat of Gehenna looms, the final battle in the Sabbat's nigh-unwinnable war against the Ancients.<br /> <br /> It's a brutal, desparate existence, but what other choices are there?<br /> <br /> * * * <br /> <br /> By Right of Blood is a small, friendly game looking for players. We strive to stick with the themes and setting of V20, while remaining laid back about the rest.<br /> <br /> * Open slots for Sabbat vampires, revenants, ghouls, and mortals.<br /> * Opportunities for Latino and Haitian gangs, smugglers, and traffickers<br /> * Hunt Setites and monsters in the Everglades, dig up Noddist secrets, or explore the supernat